sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant PCM as Price Calculation Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant QM as Query Module
    participant CMP as Channel Mgmt Publisher
    participant CMS as Channel Mgmt System

    Note over User,CMS: === PRICE CHANGE WITH OUTBOX PATTERN ===
    User->>SPA: Confirm price change
    SPA->>GW: POST /api/prices/apply
    GW->>Kafka: Publish to price-change-commands
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 202 Accepted

    Kafka->>PCM: Consume command
    PCM->>PCM: PriceChangeApplier processes
    PCM->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    PCM->>DB: UPDATE prices SET ... (write_model)
    PCM->>DB: INSERT INTO outbox (id, event_type, payload)
    PCM->>DB: COMMIT
    Note over PCM,DB: Atomic: both succeed or both fail

    Note over PCM: OutboxPollingService (scheduled, 10ms interval)
    PCM->>DB: SELECT * FROM outbox WHERE published_at IS NULL
    DB-->>PCM: Unpublished events
    PCM->>Kafka: Publish to price-change-events
    PCM->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at=NOW() WHERE id=...
    Note over PCM: Event now in Kafka

    Kafka->>QM: Consume price-change-events
    QM->>QM: ReadModelProjector refreshes materialized view

    Note over CMP,CMS: === CHANNEL MANAGEMENT PUSH WITH RETRY ===
    Kafka->>CMP: Consume price-change-events
    CMP->>CMP: IdempotencyChecker (check event ID)
    CMP->>CMP: CircuitBreaker (check state)
    Note over CMP: Circuit breaker CLOSED
    CMP->>CMS: POST /api/channel/prices
    CMS-->>CMP: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable
    Note over CMP: Circuit breaker records failure

    CMP->>CMP: RetryHandler: exponential backoff (1s)
    Note over CMP: Wait 1 second
    CMP->>CMS: POST /api/channel/prices (retry 1)
    CMS-->>CMP: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable

    CMP->>CMP: RetryHandler: exponential backoff (2s)
    Note over CMP: Wait 2 seconds
    CMP->>CMS: POST /api/channel/prices (retry 2)
    CMS-->>CMP: HTTP 200 OK
    Note over CMP: Event delivered successfully
    CMP->>CMP: Acknowledge Kafka offset

    Note over CMP: Circuit breaker records success → resets failure count